  "result": "I found the cause and wrote a plan, but I haven't changed any code because plan mode is active. I also couldn't call ExitPlanMode, since it isn't available to me here. Please approve the plan or tell me to go ahead and I'll make the edit.\n\n**Cause:** `IntRange._clamp` in `src/click/types.py:754` returns `bound - dir`, which moves the wrong way for open bounds.\n- With `min=0, min_open=True`, a value of -5 clamps to -1 instead of 1.\n- With `max=5, max_open=True`, a value of 9 clamps to 6 instead of 4.\n\n**Fix:** change `bound - dir` to `bound + dir`.\n\n**Tests:** add two cases to the clamp parametrization in `tests/test_types.py`, one for an open min and one for an open max, then run `pytest tests/test_types.py`.\n\nThe plan is saved at `<home>\\.claude\\plans\\some-users-report-that-nifty-starfish.md`.",
